        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="table-caption">
      Success (%) over 50 trials per task and mean VLA queries per episode. The paper also
      reports π<sub>0</sub> (H = 50) and π<sub>0.5</sub> (H = 10), where PAV again has the
      highest average success (94.30% and 98.10%), plus A3, DVAC and VLA-Corrector
